    "team": [],
    "note": "A robot that trains the timer\u2019s two robots. It teaches Ask on a box with the go pad in hole 6: ask the computer the time, answered to my readings, and move the pad to hole 7. Then it teaches Tell on a box with a reading and the pad in hole 7: put the reading in a [set | value | _] letter, give it to the bird on the perch, move the pad back, and have Ruby loosen the reading. Then it takes the number\u2019s panel out, sets Tell\u2019s box, Ask and Tell on it, and folds the panel away: the number is a stopwatch."
