  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "THE TIMER TEACHER\n\nA robot that trains the two\nrobots of the timer, one\nafter the other, each on a\nbox in the state it works\nin -- then puts them on a\nnumber\u2019s panel.\n\nAsk: the go pad is in hole 6.\nAsk the computer the time,\nmove the pad to hole 7.\n\nTell: a reading, pad in 7.\nGive it to the bird on the\nperch, move the pad back."
   },
   "x": -1.15,
   "z": 2.25
  },
  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "TO RUN IT\n\nGive the seven-hole box to\nthe teacher and press Start.\n\nAsk really asks: the\ncomputer\u2019s answer lands on\nthe nest in its box. Tell\nreally tells: its letter\ngoes to the bird on the\nperch, and out here she\ntakes it to \u201cwhat it told\u201d.\n\nThen the number\u2019s panel\ncomes out, the box and the\ntwo robots go on it, and\nit folds away."
   },
   "x": -0.45,
   "z": 2.25
  },
  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "THE STOPWATCH\n\nTake the number out of the\nteacher\u2019s box and press\nSPACE on it: it counts the\nmilliseconds. \u201c.\u201d rests it.\n\nOpen its panel with the\ngear: the box and the team\nare there, and the bird on\nthe perch is a bird to the\nnumber."
   },
   "x": 0.25,
   "z": 2.25
  },
  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "HOW IT REACHES THEM\n\nA little robot the teacher\ntaught stays among its\nthings: \u201cthe first little\nrobot it taught\u201d, at its own\ndesk, with its box. Click\nthe pupil with an empty\nclaw to pick it up; click\nthe box on its desk to take\nthat.\n\nOne asks and one tells\nbecause a robot cannot wait\nmid-round for an answer."
   },
   "x": 0.95,
   "z": 2.25
  }
